1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Veridelta compares two datasets on their primary keys and reports every row that differs under the rules you declare.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,000
veridelta run compares them: 1 row added, 1 removed, and 1 changed.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,700
The exit code, 1, tells CI that the datasets differ.

4
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:19,700
pip install veridelta. The docs are at veridelta.github.io/veridelta.
